KADID-10k Reference Images
===========================

These 81 pristine reference images are from the KADID-10k (Konstanz Artificially
Distorted Image quality Database) dataset.

Source: https://database.mmsp-kn.de/kadid-10k-database.html

License
-------
The pristine images were collected from Pixabay.com and released under the
Pixabay License, which permits free use for commercial and non-commercial
purposes without attribution (though attribution is appreciated).

The KADID-10k database is "freely available to the research community."

Citation
--------
If you use these images in research, please cite:

  Lin, Hanhe; Hosu, Vlad; Saupe, Dietmar. "KADID-10k: A Large-scale
  Artificially Distorted IQA Database." Tenth International Conference
  on Quality of Multimedia Experience (QoMEX), IEEE, 2019.

  BibTeX:
